  "answer": "This has been reported before. The main tracking ticket is terminal#16629, and later reports were closed as duplicates of it. It is a regression in the Settings UI. If you scroll while a ComboBox dropdown is open, the dropdown moves with the page and can leave the Terminal window. Older versions closed the dropdown when you started scrolling. The tickets say nothing about a fix or a setting you can change. Until it is fixed, close the dropdown (Esc, or select an item) before you scroll. Don't use the mouse wheel while a dropdown is open. Add your details and a thumbs-up to terminal#16629 so it gets prioritised."
 },
